theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Last updated: September 17, 2026

[b]What we collect[/b]
We don't require an account. Jetlet: Solar Escape shows ads through Google AdMob, which can collect your device's advertising ID, device info, IP-derived approximate location, and ad interaction data to serve and measure ads. We also send anonymous gameplay events (session length, run score/streak/duration, milestones reached) to Google Analytics, tied to a random per-install id rather than your identity. If the app crashes, Firebase Crashlytics collects a crash report (device info and the crash's stack trace) to help us fix it. High score, stats and settings themselves stay on your device.

[b]Third parties[/b]
Google AdMob serves and measures ads in the app, Google Analytics processes the anonymous gameplay events above, and Firebase Crashlytics processes crash reports. See Google's privacy policy at policies.google.com/privacy for details on how Google handles that data.

[b]Your choices[/b]
Where required, a consent form lets you decline ad personalization. You can also reset or limit your device's advertising ID in your system settings, or opt out of interest-based Google ads at adssettings.google.com.

[b]Children[/b]
Jetlet: Solar Escape is intended for a general audience and is not directed at children under 13.

[b]Contact[/b]
support.eternalsky@gmail.com"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = true

